   "evidence": "TauCeti/AlgebraicGeometry/EllipticCurve/Affine/Singular.lean:549 `theorem ne_zero_of_isSingular_zero [IsReduced R] (h0 : W.IsSingular 0 0) {x y : R} (h : W.Nonsingular x y) : x \u2260 0`; Singular.lean:145 `@[simp] theorem isSingular_zero : W.IsSingular 0 0 \u2194 W.a\u2086 = 0 \u2227 W.a\u2084 = 0 \u2227 W.a\u2083 = 0`; Montgomery/Basic.lean:93-95 `model_a\u2083 = 0`, `model_a\u2084 = B ^ 2`, `model_a\u2086 = 0`. Singular.lean imports nothing from Montgomery, so the new import makes no cycle.",
